스","x":888,"y":916,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"전체가","x":1022,"y":916,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"실행되기","x":1123,"y":916,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"전에","x":1256,"y":916,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"메모리로","x":1331,"y":917,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"올라","x":1472,"y":917,"width":67,"height":35}]},{"text":"와야 한다는 것을 전제로 하고 있다.","words":[{"text":"와야","x":280,"y":973,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"한다는","x":362,"y":973,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"것을","x":480,"y":973,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"전제로","x":558,"y":973,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"하고","x":665,"y":973,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":743,"y":974,"width":66,"height":34}]},{"text":"가상 메모리(virtual memory)라는 것은 프로세스 전체가 메모리 내에 올라오지","words":[{"text":"가상","x":346,"y":1031,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"메모리(virtual","x":432,"y":1032,"width":226,"height":37},{"text":"memory)라는","x":675,"y":1033,"width":211,"height":40},{"text":"것은","x":903,"y":1034,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스","x":976,"y":1034,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"전체가","x":1114,"y":1035,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"메모리","x":1219,"y":1035,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"내에","x":1328,"y":1035,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"올라오지","x":1405,"y":1035,"width":130,"height":35}]},{"text":"않더라도 실행이 기능하도록 하는 기법이다. 이 기법의 주요 장점 중 하나는 사용자 프","words":[{"text":"않더라도","x":281,"y":1091,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"실행이","x":435,"y":1091,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"기능하도록","x":552,"y":1091,"width":160,"height":35},{"text":"하는","x":726,"y":1091,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"기법이다.","x":804,"y":1092,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":949,"y":1093,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"기법의","x":992,"y":1094,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"주요","x":1093,"y":1096,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"장점","x":1167,"y":1094,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"중","x":1240,"y":1096,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"하나는","x":1285,"y":1095,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"사용자","x":1393,"y":1094,"width":100,"heigh