92,"height":35},{"text":"통해","x":1392,"y":1272,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"프로","x":1473,"y":1276,"width":66,"height":27}]},{"text":"그래머는 메모리의 크기에 제약으로부터 자유로워진다. 또한, 가상 메모리는 파일과 라","words":[{"text":"그래머는","x":282,"y":1329,"width":138,"height":34},{"text":"메모리의","x":435,"y":1329,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"크기에","x":584,"y":1330,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"제약으로부터","x":696,"y":1330,"width":181,"height":35},{"text":"자유로워진다.","x":895,"y":1330,"width":188,"height":36},{"text":"또한,","x":1099,"y":1331,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"가상","x":1182,"y":1331,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"메모리는","x":1256,"y":1331,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"파일과","x":1393,"y":1331,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"라","x":1507,"y":1332,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"이브러리의 공유를 쉽게 해주고 공유 메모리 구현을 가능하게 한다. 추가로, 프로세스 생","words":[{"text":"이브러리의","x":284,"y":1387,"width":166,"height":35},{"text":"공유를","x":465,"y":1388,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":"쉽게","x":580,"y":1388,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"해주고","x":656,"y":1389,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"공유","x":761,"y":1389,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"메모리","x":835,"y":1389,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"구현을","x":937,"y":1390,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"가능하게","x":1040,"y":1389,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1170,"y":1389,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"추가로,","x":1250,"y":1390,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스","x":1364,"y":1389,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"생","x":1505,"y":1390,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"성을 효율적으로 처리할 수 있는 기법도 제공한다. 그러나 이러한 가상 메모리는 구현하","words":[{"text":"성을","x":284,"y":1447,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"효율적으로","x":364,"y":1446,"width":171,"height":35},{"text":"처리할","x":549,"y":1447,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":657,"y":1448,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":705,"y":1448,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"기법도","x":778,"y":1448,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"제공한다.","x":881,"y":1448,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"그러나","x":1022,"y":1448,"width":92